   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "BERTH YIELD / RESUME - the simple one\n\nProblem: when Berth owns the GPU, an LLM call made from inside a ComfyUI job waits for the card while the job (which holds the card) waits for the LLM. Deadlock (berth#299).\n\nFix: Berth Yield frees ComfyUI's models and hands the card to Berth; the LLM node then runs; Berth Resume takes the card back. The graph's links fix the order, so wire: idea -> YIELD -> LLM -> RESUME -> rest."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
